    {
      "id": "Mdon8IFaH0sVl7H2Kzo1t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2007.962379381444,
      "y": 872.5983402857516,
      "width": 816.3992309570312,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aO",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 795108605,
      "version": 86,
      "versionNonce": 2044044147,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785870922504,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "We want to draw a line from P to a point Q in direction to the normal of the point.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "We want to draw a line from P to a point Q in direction to the normal of the point.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "GDngwjdgh6l2CtcMtBvHY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2156.3003285505342,
      "y": 958.7078332757367,
      "width": 455.319580078125,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aP",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 834885117,
      "version": 61,
      "versionNonce": 2142669491,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785870975106,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q = P + P.normal.normalize() * normalDistance: ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Q = P + P.normal.normalize() * normalDistance: ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ecEwBPWtpgaKvM-uuh-Af",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2028.0116609595618,
      "y": 1028.6337436126307,
      "width": 424.05963134765625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aQ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 629389811,
      "version": 64,
      "versionNonce": 70958685,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785871024610,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The result is a line that goes from P to Q.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The result is a line that goes from P to Q.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ato_lXIsCmWoxnNklPWHv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2256.631988784238,
      "y": 1087.4608078936872,
      "width": 94.31991577148438,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aR",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 509250333,
      "version": 27,
      "versionNonce": 591138205,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785871041836,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Line(P, Q)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Line(P, Q)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "DzmGNtxn1ARBya-dcisFM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1989.2324836515722,
      "y": 1140.8211339598479,
      "width": 1027.3790283203125,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 910232157,
      "version": 205,
      "versionNonce": 974551965,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785871090435,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Each of those P and Q, because of how the renderer is built, must be a VertexOut, which cointains a lot\nof information (worldPosition, ndcPosition, worldNormal)...",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Each of those P and Q, because of how the renderer is built, must be a VertexOut, which cointains a lot\nof information (worldPosition, ndcPosition, worldNormal)...",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "dEqY5ts3eGEZNzKTD0lBf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2032.5847671567813,
      "y": 1210.4512870809274,
      "width": 916.63916015625,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1876424797,
      "version": 184,
      "versionNonce": 1459299059,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785871127855,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "For P, we just have to copy the information and, maybe, ASSIGN A NEW COLOUR (so the line\nwill eventually also be coloured using that colour). However, what do with Q?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "For P, we just have to copy the information and, maybe, ASSIGN A NEW COLOUR (so the line\nwill eventually also be coloured using that colour). However, what do with Q?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "J-aco0pYZuXru-TwKsoan",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2173.7150222473165,
      "y": 1294.4081741508746,
      "width": 948.3990478515625,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 305087027,
      "version": 411,
      "versionNonce": 36905981,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785871626514,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "We can just be sure of one thing: we know Q world position and, because of the eventual use\nof the MVP, its clip position. With that, we can obtain ndc and screen position of Q. That's nice.\n\nNow, we also have in vertexOut \"worldNormal\", which we can suppose is equal to P worldNormal,\nand viewNormal, which we can also suppose equals to P viewNormal.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "We can just be sure of one thing: we know Q world position and, because of the eventual use\nof the MVP, its clip position. With that, we can obtain ndc and screen position of Q. That's nice.\n\nNow, we also have in vertexOut \"worldNormal\", which we can suppose is equal to P worldNormal,\nand viewNormal, which we can also suppose equals to P viewNormal.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
